  "notes": "TCL BeyondTV, Poland unit (ro.product.model BeyondTV, board RTD2851 / rtd285o, build PPR1.180610.011 AP03,\nsecurity patch 2020-02-05), Android TV 9 (API 28), 2 GB RAM, Polish UI. Same platform as\nexamples/tcl-beyondtv-rt2851/ (build AP06), which was used as the starting point.\nTested 2026-10-21: applied in groups with a screenshot after each, then one reboot; Home, the Inputs menu,\nthe remote's Source/Settings buttons and Netflix checked. Not yet lived with for days.\n\nApply:   TV_HOST=<tv ip> tools/disable.sh examples/tcl-beyondtv-pl/debloat.txt\nUndo:    TV_HOST=<tv ip> tools/restore.sh examples/tcl-beyondtv-pl/debloat.txt\nStock launcher: com.google.android.tvlauncher. Live TV app: com.tcl.tv. Tuner: com.tcl.tvinput. HDMI: com.tcl.tvpassthrough.\n\nDO NOT DISABLE (load-bearing on this firmware): com.tcl.tv com.tcl.tvinput com.tcl.tvpassthrough\ncom.tcl.sourcemananger com.tcl.keycustomfunctionservice com.tcl.framework.custom com.tcl.tcl_bt_rcu_service\ncom.tcl.autopair com.tcl.inputmethod.international com.tcl.settings com.tcl.initsetup com.tcl.factory.view\ncom.tcl.showmode com.tcl.xian.StartandroidService com.tcl.appstatecontroller com.realtek.netflix.setting\ncom.android.WifiCountryService com.tcl.versionUpdateApp (firmware updater, kept by choice) com.tcl.rc.ota\n\nRe-enabled by the firmware at every boot (checked after a reboot): com.tcl.notereminder. Left alone.\n\nAlready disabled at the factory, left alone: the uk.co.freeview.* apps, com.tcl.bootadservice,\ncom.tcl.common.terminalmanagerplus, com.tcl.gallery, com.tcl.smartalexa, Stan, ZEE5, LINE TV, Rakuten TV,\nPlay Music/Games/Movies, Eros Now, com.google.android.tv.remote.service.\n1. Telemetry and analytics",
